            THIS IS A TELEGRAM BOT REPOSITORY
In this Repository there is everything i used to make this work.
I have done most of the work with the help of Claude AI.
I also used Visual studio community (2026 version) to 
write the code, execute it, and to troubleshoot errors that
occured along with the development of given bot.
What is this bot supposed to do?
1. As soon as it loads, its supposed to notify you
(" GitHub notifier started.")
2. To constantly refresh any repository i have access to (includes private
repositories of other people, but only if they have given me the access)
3. in a short period of time (30 seconds to 5 minutes), 
notify the groupchat about all new changes commited.
